": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210393_852485259855759_6019629505745872437_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OXKlupoBl5QQ7kNvwE0eupc&_nc_oc=AdrP-URYwLSIxpI5N3f0sD-QPKSSrTkoALamYnje4X0xRYnxh2qPIHpqHL-AUbhrRew&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEMAKB-51XVp4JN5ielrhSL_EaorSHR8w-SLRu99v6Yxw&oe=6A8990DB"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pflFbdyEV64Q7kNvwGAPM2E&_nc_oc=AdoAXUAF4Ix4jOj7PZmTNyEV5hiGJ7SY9mq86d98NCpBrByfJ3Bbg0UmJXE5u9omyIo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHbtC0aTDps8a8u0I6D8rnBqjJXrE3Ehxq2rt40kJ5saA&oe=6A898121"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=erolU1Ow0JEQ7kNvwGpUlJd&_nc_oc=AdplMYoR5P782fF_iZWNyoqdM4T3qk4sJu4IiU3YuQnaLkI5W2R9DD1TAPKBpe2hzHg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFrdoHkz7J07R6UhwknRchdw9VHLfXK2QrjyRRWo1hc9A&oe=6A896DEF"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1ysVkHjEHEQQ7kNvwFy2BCR&_nc_oc=AdqNaldBoOViWNUHxBJXxu5jeP584qmVaiMR2TmaqT_smIthLbt6UWXi3J9IvX9d3bc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEdzsEAuWI-BgVvFy8JiXTmV7wYKtj0B5gXUh32M4dYog&oe=6A896D92"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2kVmLbHBuB8Q7kNvwH0gPGp&_nc_oc=AdrDxcCEFcU3yri_PFF5coJRVICcfzB2WMYdSwRurk_twItFgAMXr9vYfLbZtGqRh0g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE_P9mRxAMlyXeu45QaDa0cnXxL8aD2NmSHryNaI8Eiew&oe=6A89773D"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.a